  "title": "In the Name of Chivalry III",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">In the Name of Chivalry III</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Daily_Quests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Daily Quests\">Daily</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"startLocation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Starting Location</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Whisperwind_Haven\" title=\"Whisperwind Haven\">Whisperwind Haven</a>,&#32;<a href=\"/wiki/Rinascita\" title=\"Rinascita\">Rinascita</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Description</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">It's time to fulfill your promise to Faro. Set up a training session to get him started.</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\">Previous Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\"><a href=\"/wiki/In_the_Name_of_Chivalry_II\" title=\"In the Name of Chivalry II\">In the Name of Chivalry II</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/In_the_Name_of_Chivalry_IV\" title=\"In the Name of Chivalry IV\">In the Name of Chivalry IV</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRewards\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCharacters\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rewards\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"card-list-container\"><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-4\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Intimacy\" title=\"Intimacy\"><img alt=\"Intimacy\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Intimacy.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Intimacy.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/4/45/Item_Intimacy.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240528230213\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 480</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shell_Credit\" title=\"Shell Credit\"><img alt=\"Shell Credit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Shell Credit.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Shell_Credit.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d1/Item_Shell_Credit.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523132525\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 3,000</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-2\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Basic_Resonance_Potion\" title=\"Basic Resonance Potion\"><img alt=\"Basic Resonance Potion\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Basic Resonance Potion.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Basic_Resonance_Potion.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/60/Item_Basic_Resonance_Potion.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240528230303\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 1</span></span></div></span></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"characters\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Faro\" title=\"Faro\">Faro</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>In the Name of Chivalry III</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Daily_Quest\" title=\"Daily Quest\">Daily Quest</a> that occurs in <a href=\"/wiki/Whisperwind_Haven\" title=\"Whisperwind Haven\">Whisperwind Haven</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rinascita\" title=\"Rinascita\">Rinascita</a>, [[{{{nation}}}]].\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>Talk to Faro</li>\n<li>Break the Rock</li>\n<li>Talk to Faro</li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dd><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-title\"><b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"UI Quest\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0f/UI_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20260501180345\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"UI Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"UI_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Quest Description</b></div><hr class=\"description-separator\" /><div class=\"description-content\">It's time to fulfill your promise to Faro. Set up a training session to get him started.</div></div></dd>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dd><b>Faro:</b> So, today's training's about breaking rocks? I remember I once heard from a Pioneer Association member that...</dd>\n<dd><b>Faro:</b> Breaking rocks with your chest is quite popular somewhere outside of Rinascita.</dd>\n<dd><b><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span></b> I think you might have misunderstood.\n<dl><dd><b>Faro:</b> Haha,  you're right. It's impossible for an ordinary person to do that!</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><b><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span></b> Well then, today's training is \"breaking rocks with your chest.\"\n<dl><dd><b>Faro:</b> What? Really? But that sounds impossible!</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Alright, chit-chat's over. Today, we simply focus on fundamental strength training. We'll be shattering the rocks with our weapons.</dd>\n<dd><b>Faro:</b> Just like how you got the Sword in the Rock? I'm ready. We can start any time!</dd>\n<dd><b><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span></b> No rush. I'll show you how it's done first.</dd>\n<dd><b>Faro:</b> Understood! I'll watch and learn carefully!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><b>Faro:</b> Wow! That was so smooth! A solid rock like this crumbled like a crispy cookie under your strike!</dd>\n<dd><b><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span></b> Go practice.\n<dl><dd><b>Faro:</b> Understood! I'll work hard and become a master of rock breaking!</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><b><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span></b> Now you're making me hungry.\n<dl><dd><b>Faro:</b> Haha, after seeing your moves, I'll work hard and become a master of rock breaking!</dd>\n<dd><b><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span></b> ...I recall you wanted to be a knight, right?</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><b>Under your guidance, Faro has fully trained his strength...</b></dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(If <a href=\"/wiki/Chest_Mimic\" title=\"Chest Mimic\">Chest Mimic</a> appears)</dt>\n<dd><b>Faro:</b> What? A Tacet Discord in the stone?!</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Looks like today's strength training just turned into a real combat session.</dd></dl>\n<dl><dt>(After defeating the Chest Mimic)</dt>\n<dd><b>Faro:</b> Sorry, I messed up again. I didn't help at all and just had you protect me once more...</dd>\n<dd><b><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span></b> Are you alright?</dd>\n<dd><b>Faro:</b> Yeah, just a few bruises. A good rest will heal them.</dd>\n<dd><b>Faro:</b> I need to practice more. I couldn't even catch your moves!</dd>\n<dd><b><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span></b> That happens a lot for beginners.</dd>\n<dd><b><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span></b> It's because I'm strong.</dd>\n<dd><b>Faro:</b> Just give me a little more time, and I'll prove myself to you!</dd></dl>\n<dl><dt>(Quest Complete)</dt></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Version/2.0\" title=\"Version/2.0\">Version 2.0</a></b></div><div>[<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/In_the_Name_of_Chivalry_III/Change_History?action=edit&amp;preload=Template:Change_History/Preload&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=2.0&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=In+the+Name+of+Chivalry+III\">Create New History</a>]</div></div></div><div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Navigation\">Navigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"navbox-border navbox\" style=\"border-spacing:0;;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:2px;\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"nowraplinks hlist mw-collapsible navbox-inner\" style=\"border-spacing:0;background:transparent;color:inherit;;\"><tbody><tr><th style=\";\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"navbox-title\"><div class=\"hidden\" style=\"float:left;width:6em;text-align:left\">&#160;</div><span class=\"\" style=\"font-size:110%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Quests\">Quests</a></span></th></tr><tr style=\"height:2px;\"><td></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"navbox-group\" style=\";;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Main_Quests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Main Quests\">Main Quests</a></th><td style=\"text-align:left;border-left-width:2px;border-left-style:solid;width:100%;padding:0px;;;\" class=\"navbox-list navbox-odd\"><div style=\"padding:0em 0.25em\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Utterance_of_Marvels:_I\" title=\"Utterance of Marvels: I\"> Prologue: Utterance of Marvels</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/First_Resonance\" title=\"First Resonance\">Chapter 1: Huanglong I</a></li></ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height:2px\"><td></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"navbox-group\" style=\";;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tutorial_Quests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tutorial Quests\">Tutorial Quests</a></th><td style=\"text-align:left;border-left-width:2px;border-left-style:solid;width:100%;padding:0px;;;\" class=\"navbox-list navbox-even\"